{"n":3,"title":"Data and the vocabulary","part":"A","partName":"The big picture","words":997,"minutes":5,"sections":[{"id":"h-31-a-dataset-is-a-table","title":"3.1 A dataset is a table"},{"id":"h-32-notation","title":"3.2 Notation"},{"id":"h-33-parameters-and-hyperparameters","title":"3.3 Parameters and hyperparameters"},{"id":"h-34-train-validation-and-test-sets","title":"3.4 Train, validation and test sets"},{"id":"h-35-data-quality","title":"3.5 Data quality"},{"id":"h-36-always-measure-a-baseline","title":"3.6 Always measure a baseline"}],"speechHash":"b0679b07","fa":{"total":39,"translated":39},"html":"<p><strong><span data-s=\"0\" data-w=\"0\">Purpose.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"0\">Nearly</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"1\">every</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"2\">formula</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"3\">in</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"4\">this</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"5\">book</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"6\">uses</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"8\">same</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"9\">few</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"10\">symbols.</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"0\">Learn</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"1\">them</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"2\">once</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"3\">here.</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"0\">Also</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"1\">learn</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"2\">why</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"3\">data</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"4\">quality</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"6\">honest</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"7\">testing</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"8\">matter</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"9\">more</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"10\">than</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"11\">any</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"12\">algorithm.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>هدف.</strong> تقریباً هر فرمول این کتاب از همان چند نماد استفاده می‌کند. آن‌ها را یک بار اینجا یاد بگیر. همچنین یاد بگیر چرا کیفیت داده و آزمون صادقانه از هر الگوریتمی مهم‌تر است.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"0\">Key</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"1\">ideas</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>ایده‌های کلیدی</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"1\">dataset</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"4\">table.</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"1\">row</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"3\">one</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"4\">example,</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"6\">column</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"8\">one</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"9\">feature,</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"11\">one</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"12\">special</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"13\">column</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"14\">is</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"16\">target</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"17\">(the</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"18\">label).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموعه‌داده یک جدول است. هر سطر یک نمونه است، هر ستون یک ویژگی، و یک ستون ویژه هدف (برچسب) است.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"0\">Parameters</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"1\">are</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"2\">learned</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"3\">by</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"4\">training.</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"0\">Hyperparameters</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"1\">are</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"2\">chosen</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"3\">by</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"4\">you</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"5\">before</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"6\">training.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">پارامترها با آموزش یاد گرفته می‌شوند. ابرپارامترها را خودت پیش از آموزش انتخاب می‌کنی.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"0\">Always</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"1\">test</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"2\">on</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"3\">data</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"5\">model</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"6\">never</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"7\">saw.</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">Split</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">data</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">into</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"4\">training,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"5\">validation</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"7\">test</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"8\">sets.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">همیشه روی داده‌ای تست کن که مدل هرگز ندیده. داده را به مجموعه‌های آموزش، اعتبارسنجی و تست تقسیم کن.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"0\">Before</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"1\">building</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"3\">model,</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"4\">measure</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"6\">trivial</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"7\">baseline.</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"1\">model</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"3\">does</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"4\">not</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"5\">beat</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"6\">it</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"8\">useless.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">پیش از ساختن مدل، یک مدل پایه‌ی بدیهی را اندازه بگیر. مدلی که از آن بهتر نباشد بی‌فایده است.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-31-a-dataset-is-a-table\"><span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"0\">3.1</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"1\">A</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"2\">dataset</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"5\">table</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">3.1 مجموعه‌داده یک جدول است</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">Here</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">are</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">five</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"3\">rows</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"4\">of</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"6\">loan-offers</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"7\">table.</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">values</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">are</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">made</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">up</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">for</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">illustration.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">اینجا پنج سطر از جدول پیشنهادهای وام است. مقدارها برای توضیح ساختگی‌اند.</div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>OfferedAmount (EUR)</th>\n<th>NumberOfTerms</th>\n<th>CreditScore</th>\n<th>Accepted (target)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>720</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>25,000</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>650</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>780</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>40,000</td>\n<td>84</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>15,000</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td>690</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">Columns</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">1</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">to</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">3</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">are</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">inputs</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">(features).</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">last</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">column</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"4\">what</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"6\">want</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"7\">to</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"8\">predict</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"9\">(the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"10\">target,</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"11\">or</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"12\">label).</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">Each</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">row</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">one</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"4\">training</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"5\">example.</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">model</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">learns</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">from</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"5\">rows</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"6\">where</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"8\">target</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"9\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"10\">known,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"12\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"13\">then</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"14\">used</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"15\">on</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"16\">new</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"17\">rows</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"18\">where</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"19\">it</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"20\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"21\">not.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">ستون‌های 1 تا 3 ورودی‌ها (ویژگی‌ها) هستند. ستون آخر چیزی است که می‌خواهی پیش‌بینی کنی (هدف، یا برچسب). هر سطر یک نمونه‌ی آموزشی است. مدل از سطرهایی که هدفشان معلوم است یاد می‌گیرد و بعد روی سطرهای جدیدی که هدفشان معلوم نیست به کار می‌رود.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-32-notation\"><span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">3.2</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">Notation</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">3.2 نمادگذاری</div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Symbol</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n<th>In the table above</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>m</td>\n<td>number of training examples</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n</td>\n<td>number of features</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x</td>\n<td>the input features</td>\n<td>the first three columns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>y</td>\n<td>the target, the true answer</td>\n<td>the Accepted column</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(x^(i), y^(i))</td>\n<td>the i-th training example (the superscript is a row number, not a power)</td>\n<td>row 2: x^(2) = [25000, 60, 650], y^(2) = 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x^(i)_j</td>\n<td>feature j of example i</td>\n<td>x^(2)_3 = 650</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>f(x) or y-hat</td>\n<td>the model's prediction</td>\n<td>what the model says for a row</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>w, b</td>\n<td>the parameters (weights and bias)</td>\n<td>learned by training</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">vector</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"3\">just</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"5\">list</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"6\">of</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"7\">numbers.</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"8\">x^(2)</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"9\">is</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"11\">vector</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"12\">of</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"13\">all</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"14\">features</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"15\">of</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"17\">second</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"18\">row.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">بردار فقط فهرستی از عددهاست. <code>x^(2)</code> بردار همه‌ی ویژگی‌های سطر دوم است.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-33-parameters-and-hyperparameters\"><span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">3.3</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">Parameters</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">and</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">hyperparameters</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">3.3 پارامترها و ابرپارامترها</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">Parameters</span></strong> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">are</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">numbers</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"5\">algorithm</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"6\">learns:</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"7\">w</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"9\">b</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"10\">in</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"11\">a</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"12\">line,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"14\">weights</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"15\">in</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"17\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"18\">network.</span> <strong><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">Hyperparameters</span></strong> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">are</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">settings</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"3\">you</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"4\">choose</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"5\">before</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"6\">training</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"8\">that</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"9\">training</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"10\">does</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"11\">not</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"12\">change:</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"14\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"15\">rate,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"17\">number</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"18\">of</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"19\">passes</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"20\">over</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"21\">the</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"22\">data</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"23\">(epochs),</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"24\">K</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"25\">in</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"26\">nearest</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"27\">neighbours,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"28\">the</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"29\">regularization</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"30\">strength,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"31\">the</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"32\">polynomial</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"33\">degree.</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"1\">find</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"2\">good</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"3\">hyperparameters</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"4\">by</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"5\">trying</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"6\">values</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"8\">measuring</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"9\">on</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"10\">held-out</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"11\">data,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"12\">not</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"13\">by</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"14\">guessing</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"15\">(Shaw</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"16\">Talebi).</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>پارامترها</strong> عددهایی هستند که الگوریتم یاد می‌گیرد: <code>w</code> و <code>b</code> در یک خط، وزن‌ها در یک شبکه‌ی عصبی. <strong>ابرپارامترها</strong> تنظیم‌هایی هستند که پیش از آموزش انتخاب می‌کنی و آموزش تغییرشان نمی‌دهد: نرخ یادگیری، تعداد گذر روی داده (epoch)، <code>K</code> در نزدیک‌ترین همسایه‌ها، قدرت منظم‌سازی، درجه‌ی چندجمله‌ای. ابرپارامترهای خوب را با امتحان کردن مقدارها و اندازه‌گیری روی داده‌ی کنارگذاشته‌شده پیدا می‌کنی، نه با حدس زدن (Shaw Talebi).</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-34-train-validation-and-test-sets\"><span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"0\">3.4</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"1\">Train,</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"2\">validation</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"3\">and</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"4\">test</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"5\">sets</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">3.4 مجموعه‌های آموزش، اعتبارسنجی و تست</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">model</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"3\">scores</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"4\">well</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"5\">on</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"7\">examples</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"8\">it</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"9\">was</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"10\">fitted</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"11\">to</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"12\">has</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"13\">proved</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"14\">nothing,</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"15\">just</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"16\">as</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"17\">a</s